{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/60857c55448759bf266507cecd99cd36.avif?t=1761234916\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong>\u00a0combines the charm and nostalgia of classic point-and-click adventures with a chilling horror atmosphere. Explore an old manor shrouded in mystery, solve puzzles rooted in your surroundings, and uncover the secrets of this forgotten place - it may seem abandoned at first glance, but you\u2019re certain that you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/e17c4422e11eace38d0936d716cbafae.poster.avif?t=1761234916\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/e17c4422e11eace38d0936d716cbafae.webm?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/e17c4422e11eace38d0936d716cbafae.mp4?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Point-and-Click Gameplay</strong>: Reminiscent of the classics, but with the responsiveness and polish that you expect in modern games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Engaging Puzzles</strong>: Rummage through the manor, find useful items and solve a variety of environmental puzzles to uncover the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Survival Horror:</strong>\u00a0Your surroundings are dark and dangerous, something is lurking around the corner, and your only chance of survival is to remain undetected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong>: An original soundtrack and handcrafted sound effects designed to immerse you into this unsettling world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/9a766fcdf5ea9b020edbb7c1ae3250d5.poster.avif?t=1761234916\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/9a766fcdf5ea9b020edbb7c1ae3250d5.webm?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/9a766fcdf5ea9b020edbb7c1ae3250d5.mp4?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong>\u00a0is a deeply personal project from two lifelong friends: one solo developer and one sound designer. It\u2019s the result of passion, persistence, and countless late nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support means the world - wishlist now to be notified on release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/575148e5b3b4025f339fe26f90aafe3c.poster.avif?t=1761234916\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/575148e5b3b4025f339fe26f90aafe3c.webm?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/575148e5b3b4025f339fe26f90aafe3c.mp4?t=1761234916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453420?t=1761234916","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.ste